; ==========================================
; CHALLENGE 2: Rocket Launch Countdown
; Language: Kikuyu / Gĩkũyũ (ki)
; ==========================================
; Count down from 5 to 1, then launch!

thaama counter 5

launch_loop:
gwĩta_kĩbũrũri counter
eheria counter 1
ringithania counter 0
if_different launch_loop

; Blastoff!
thaama box 999
gwĩta_kĩbũrũri box
